### Get all users
GET http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/users
Accept: application/json

### Get user by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/users?id=1
Accept: application/json

### Add user
POST http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Ali",
  "email": "ali@example.com"
}

### Test duplicate email
POST http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Another Ali",
  "email": "ali@example.com"
}
